and y Biota. En Manhattan, Suicide (sintetizador y voz; inventan el «psychobilly») y los Feelies.","color":"#fb7185","family":"Punk, new wave, hardcore y noise","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#blank-generation"},{"id":79811058028299,"name":"Plunderphonics","book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","start":1985,"end":1995,"desc":"Apropiacionismo: música concreta, arte sonoro y actitud punk usando sin permiso cualquier sonido, sobre todo los protegidos por copyright.","color":"#8b7cf6","family":"Vanguardia y experimental","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#plunderphonics"},{"id":216316010873033,"name":"Mash-up","book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","start":2001,"end":2008,"desc":"La unión de dos o más piezas preexistentes que encajan rítmica y armónicamente para crear una nueva: el apropiacionismo en su mayor expresión popular.","color":"#f87171","family":"Hip hop, breaks y ritmo lento","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#mash-up"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":155796143875024,"artist":"Negativland","artist_id":189101519290908,"title":"Negativland","year":1980,"ess":0,"yt":"DV08nrktjlI","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"La blank generation (Akron, San Francisco, Manhattan)","scene_id":268148682533131,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#blank-generation","chapters":["Sección 5.3"],"pages":[[1,126,null]]},{"id":144968928656031,"artist":"Negativland","artist_id":189101519290908,"title":"Points","year":1981,"ess":0,"yt":"yy11T6Ri0hk","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"La blank generation (Akron, San Francisco, Manhattan)","scene_id":268148682533131,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.git